Short:        Converts binary file to C source.
Author:       LeMUr/blabla (Lukasz Prokulski)
Uploader:     thufor zeus gliwice edu pl (Dariusz J  Garbowski)
Type:         dev/c
Requires:     OS2.0+
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

               YET ANOTHER PRODUCT FROM BLABLA GROUP!

    This is a little command that generates data-source for C from
binary file. It's all!

    Using:

        Bin2C <in_file> <out_file>

    This archive contains source of Bin2C in C.

    Look at dev/asm/2b_Bin2Asm.lha - it converts binary files to assembler
source.
